  "notes": "New\n- Give your expenses your own labels, such as Daily, Baby or Self, each with a name and a colour. You can filter the Expenses page by label and see how much each label took up this month.\n- The focus timer now runs as one timer on your phone and computer. Start, pause or skip it on one device and the other follows, and focus time is no longer counted twice.\n\nImproved\n- Today now shows a short summary tile for each part of the app, including expenses, notes and boards, plus an Up next list of the three things to deal with first.\n- Each page now has a single add button that adds that page's own kind of item. The separate quick-add menu is gone, so phones no longer show two different plus buttons.\n- Today always stays first in the main tabs, so the app opens on it and the back button returns to it.\n- The card editor no longer asks you to pick personal or work.\n- The app icon on Linux and Windows is larger and fits in better beside other apps.",
